**Solution Overview**

* **Page size:** Full‑screen (`height: 100vh`) – no scrollbars.  
* **Background:** Pure black (`#000`).  
* **Hero section:**  
  * A `<video>` element playing in the centre (you can replace the URL with any video you like).  
  * Large bold white heading **“Explore Zeroh”** centred.  
  * Below the heading a button **“Join Waitlist”**.  

* **Button behaviour**  
  * **Default state** – transparent background, white outline (`border: 2px solid #fff`), opacity ~70 % → looks “faded”.  
  * **Hover** – opacity → 100 %, background turns white, text turns black, border colour changes to black. This creates the requested transition to a full white button with black text.

---

### Complete Code (copy‑paste into an `index.html` file)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Explore Zeroh</title>
  <style>
    /* -------------------------------------------------
       Global reset & page setup
       ------------------------------------------------- */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: #000;               /* black background */
      height: 100vh;                        /* full‑screen */
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;                     /* prevent scrollbars */
    }

    /* -------------------------------------------------
       Hero container
       ------------------------------------------------- */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Video background */
    video {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    /* Content overlay (text + button) */
    .content {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* Heading */
    h1 {
      font-size: 5rem;          /* large */
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Button */
    button {
      background: transparent;   /* transparent background */
      color: #fff;                /* white text */
      border: 2px solid #fff;     /* white outline */
      padding: 15px 30px;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;

      /* Fade‑in effect */
      opacity: 0.7;               /* faded out */
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Hover state – full white button with black text */
    button:hover {
      opacity: 1;
      background: #fff;           /* full white background */
      color: #000;                /* black text */
      border-color: #000;         /* black outline */
      transform: scale(1.05);    /* slight lift */
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="hero">
    <!-- Background video -->
    <video id="bgVideo" autoplay loop playsinline></video>

    <!-- Centered content -->
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Explore Zeroh</h1>
      <button id="joinBtn">Join Waitlist</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Simple hover handling for the button
    const btn = document.getElementById('joinBtn');

    btn.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
      btn.style.opacity = '1';
      btn.style.background = '#fff';
      btn.style.color = '#000';
      btn.style.borderColor = '#000';
    });

    btn.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
      btn.style.opacity = '0.7';
      btn.style.background = 'transparent';
      btn.style.color = '#fff';
      btn.style.borderColor = '2px solid #fff';
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
```

#### How it meets the requirements
| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| **Black background** | `body { background-color: #000; }` |
| **Not scrollable** | `body { height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }` – no scroll containers. |
| **Video in the background** | `<video id="bgVideo" autoplay loop playsinline></video>` inside `.hero`. |
| **Large bold white text “Explore Zeroh”** | `<h1>Explore Zeroh</h1>` styled with `font-size: 5rem; font-weight: bold; color:#fff;` |
| **Button under the text** | `<button id="joinBtn">Join Waitlist</button>` placed below the heading. |
| **Transparent background with white outline** | `background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff;` |
| **White text** | `color: #fff;` |
| **Faded out initially** | `opacity: 0.7;` (70 % opacity). |
| **On hover → full white button with black text** | `button:hover { opacity:1; background:#fff; color:#000; border-color:#000; transform:scale(1.05); }` |

Feel free to replace the empty `<video>` tag with any real video URL (e.g., `https://www.youtube.com/embed/...`). The rest of the markup stays the same. Enjoy!

